{"lines":[{"t":"Finally, there's horse riding. This is organised by the Equestrian Centre over near Playa","x":0.091807187673545912,"h":0.021655364826265067,"c":1,"y":0.089351753434400716,"w":0.67462600708007814},{"c":1,"t":"Cortino and it's a great experience if you're a keen horseback rider, or even if you've never","y":0.10704855731664342,"w":0.69942693074544271,"x":0.095679092267424909,"h":0.017828566386033473},{"c":1,"w":0.6821879577636718,"t":"been on a horse before. They take you down to the beach, and you can canter along the","h":0.017624487316261872,"x":0.093762385513305832,"y":0.12309418464724553},{"w":0.57677276611328132,"x":0.09380036321732059,"h":0.015804035172299669,"t":"sand and through the waves. It costs 35 euros and it's available every day.","c":1,"y":0.13989660605974352},{"w":0.49260482788085941,"x":0.091798181370567236,"c":1,"t":"So there's plenty to do in the daytime, but what about night lite?","y":0.18729420420847531,"h":0.018955403121774683},{"x":0.091869497521294932,"y":0.21136955490183551,"c":1,"t":"Well, the number one attraction's called 'Musical Favourites'. Guests enjoy a three-course","w":0.69364751180013018,"h":0.019056728907993925},{"w":0.67256891886393233,"t":"meal and unlimited free drinks, and watch a fantastic show, starting with musicals set in","x":0.093795546104206734,"y":0.22805689534278106,"h":0.016877782028333344,"c":1},{"x":0.093759607737329317,"c":1,"t":"Paris and then crossing the Atlantic to Las Vegas and finally Copacabana. At the end the","y":0.24343949236665063,"h":0.017929382179539988,"w":0.68219538370768229},{"w":0.6956199645996094,"t":"cast members come down from the stage, still in their stunning costumes, and you'll have","x":0.08994948359044154,"h":0.019599529946347616,"y":0.25927187980852184,"c":1},{"t":"a chance to chat with them. It's hugely popular, so let me know now if you're interested","x":0.091954032226677404,"h":0.01327433628318575,"y":0.27749683963756211,"c":1,"w":0.66858235677083333},{"t":"because it's no good leaving it until the last minute. It's on Friday night. Tickets are just","y":0.29310713980483016,"w":0.67061574300130211,"h":0.016933039678484474,"x":0.091887950990001549,"c":1},{"w":0.6208286031087239,"c":1,"x":0.09380203144786857,"y":0.30869044977383497,"h":0.015755993376489474,"t":"50 euros each, but for an extra 10 euros you can have a table right by the stage."},{"y":0.33280657372598943,"h":0.01611883691529703,"t":"If you'd like to go back in time, there's the Castle Feast on Saturday evening. It's held in a","x":0.090038316493734769,"w":0.69348658243815109,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016118836915297141,"t":"twelith-century castle, and you eat in the great courtyard, with ladies in long gowns serving","w":0.70114944458007811,"x":0.090038304387574417,"y":0.35018963314790286},{"h":0.014567959323695034,"w":0.68007664998372386,"t":"your food. You're given a whole chicken each, which you eat in the medieval way, using","c":1,"x":0.090038303267215458,"y":0.3662790696530378},{"h":0.014691074337579435,"c":1,"y":0.38211125135385737,"t":"your hands instead of cutlery. and you're entertained by competitions where the horseback","x":0.090038304439667718,"w":0.70114944458007811},{"c":1,"x":0.091899632690124702,"y":0.39673923221868179,"t":"riders attempt to knock one another off their horses. Then you can watch the dancers in the","h":0.015538793146685492,"w":0.70509328206380206},{"c":1,"x":0.090038320785499476,"h":0.014643298389034443,"y":0.41424418593099299,"w":0.49616856892903649,"t":"ballroom and join in as well if you want. OK, so now if anyone..."},{"x":0.5855196433754486,"y":0.44885756884242256,"t":"#1FIELTS7F42","w":0.13858846028645833,"c":0.30000001192092896,"h":0.045001583364609576},{"c":1,"x":0.091954024354290176,"y":0.47376738297963228,"t":"SECTION 3","w":0.1513409932454427,"h":0.014604710146087774},{"t":"STEPHANIE: Hello, Trevor.","h":0.01327433628318575,"w":0.19731800079345702,"x":0.091954026426615765,"y":0.5028445003423857,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.010342717321422445,"y":0.5217181762063331,"x":0.091929151757518424,"w":0.059436715443929033,"t":"TREVOR."},{"y":0.51889534872222742,"h":0.014606547566641703,"w":0.58812260945638017,"c":1,"x":0.18773946144240483,"t":"Hello, Stephanie. You said you wanted to talk about the course I'm taking on"},{"w":0.16515017191569009,"t":"literature for children.","y":0.534415275142063,"c":1,"x":0.18561735159224024,"h":0.016254581784177158},{"c":1,"t":"STEPHANIE:","y":0.55342308583920374,"w":0.076787147521972646,"x":0.091874625372127247,"h":0.010886386432478967},{"t":"That's right. I'm thinking of doing it next year, but l'd like to find out more about","x":0.18390804497475036,"c":1,"h":0.016131699462003324,"w":0.60919540405273442,"y":0.55087209325825226},{"y":0.58543562932590276,"h":0.012268276190486427,"x":0.089935441760852511,"t":"TREVOR:","w":0.061508426666259761,"c":1},{"x":0.091903534637444204,"c":1,"w":0.078645038604736331,"t":"STEPHANIE:","y":0.63349177891260322,"h":0.010632721120880095},{"h":0.011627906191665538,"c":1,"x":0.090038315109250575,"t":"TREVOR:","y":0.66569767469486496,"w":0.061302680969238285},{"c":1,"y":0.76273406441899527,"h":0.010869080438626,"t":"STEPHANIE:","x":0.091878382665672956,"w":0.078695341746012351},{"w":0.061426353454589841,"h":0.010611904255207527,"t":"TREVOR.","x":0.09189218716180865,"y":0.77885102459894151,"c":1},{"h":0.010765930494074483,"y":0.85726238357819473,"c":1,"x":0.093803370916944809,"t":"STEPHANIE:","w":0.076761074066162102},{"w":0.059386971791585294,"t":"TREVOR:","y":0.87209302312829806,"h":0.010174418520535577,"x":0.093869733229366967,"c":1},{"w":0.57088119506835944,"x":0.1877394701541987,"t":"OK, well, as you probably know, it's a one-year course. It's divided into six","y":0.58280657377084544,"h":0.014577146426464904,"c":1},{"y":0.60018963340109011,"x":0.18773947461495499,"h":0.014635948103990271,"w":0.61685821533203122,"t":"modules, and you have to take all of them. One of the most interesting ones, for","c":1},{"y":0.61545995250471097,"w":0.45223810831705724,"t":"me, at least, was about the purpose of children's literature.","h":0.015022151238095471,"x":0.1876625190456814,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"You mean, whether it should just entertain children or should be educational,","y":0.63211125135359503,"w":0.59386973063151038,"x":0.18582375527748846,"h":0.014691074337579435},{"x":0.18575666202015054,"t":"Right, and whether the teaching should be factual - giving them information","y":0.6625193208793636,"w":0.58632410685221359,"h":0.017583115815212103,"c":1},{"t":"about the world - or ethical, teaching them values. What's fascinating is that","w":0.58812260945638017,"x":0.18773946146082218,"y":0.68015170695055294,"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1},{"h":0.017850848124391971,"t":"the writer isn't necessarily conscious of the message they're conveying. For","c":1,"x":0.18386153333247315,"y":0.69467588815054915,"w":0.58824101765950521},{"t":"instance, a story might show a child who has a problem as a result of not doing","c":1,"h":0.014670861505829191,"y":0.71207332464782458,"x":0.18582376323400809,"w":0.61111109415690101},{"t":"what an adult has told them to do, implying that children should always obey","h":0.01611883691529703,"y":0.72819216178530422,"c":1,"w":0.59003829956054688,"x":0.18582376204751805},{"y":0.76010689089963202,"x":0.18363868417524232,"w":0.17108347574869792,"c":1,"h":0.014636175973074761,"t":"I see what you mean."},{"y":0.77531690966386746,"x":0.18766652902286979,"t":"That module made me realise how important stories are - they can have a","w":0.5748463948567708,"h":0.015057655411634729,"c":1},{"w":0.60344828287760421,"h":0.016118836915297141,"x":0.18582375118257269,"y":0.79203539829726721,"c":1,"t":"significant effect on children as they grow up. Actually. it inspired me to have a"},{"h":0.014553259356434811,"c":1,"t":"go at it myself. just for my own interest. I know I can't compete with the really","x":0.1858237552960505,"y":0.8081395347686714,"w":0.59386973063151038},{"w":0.61685821533203122,"c":1,"y":0.82412790711377704,"h":0.013103445320756357,"t":"popular stories, like the Harry Potter books - they're very good, and even young","x":0.18773947462061888},{"w":0.4061302693684895,"h":0.011694058154235076,"c":1,"t":"kids like my seven-year-old niece love reading them.","y":0.84007585319299627,"x":0.1877394629137511},{"h":0.014571634767631236,"c":1,"y":0.85461441185338738,"x":0.18390804502431535,"w":0.60919540405273442,"t":"Mm. I'm very interested in illustrations in stories. Is that covered in the course?"},{"t":"Yes, there's a module on pictures, and how they're sometimes central to the","x":0.18773945211770676,"y":0.87063953476876088,"w":0.58620691935221347,"h":0.0146322732628823,"c":1},{"x":0.18431683559501397,"y":0.88641845179461531,"t":"story.","w":0.047359568277994812,"h":0.017695745234242222,"c":1},{"h":0.014676373767491091,"x":0.84865900461587707,"t":"Test 4","y":0.04505813939766945,"w":0.057471262613932317,"c":1},{"w":0.036398468017578067,"h":0.013081395068451962,"t":"Q16","y":0.11046511638078771,"c":1,"x":0.82375478888393128},{"x":0.82375478888393128,"y":0.26308139545055509,"w":0.036398468017578067,"h":0.013081395068452073,"c":1,"t":"Q17"},{"c":1,"t":"Q18","w":0.034482758839925132,"h":0.013081395068451962,"x":0.82375478907226185,"y":0.29505813963660166},{"t":"Q19","x":0.82375478907226185,"h":0.013081395068451962,"c":1,"y":0.36627906986915981,"w":0.034482758839925132},{"w":0.036398468017578067,"y":0.41424418614822955,"t":"Q20","h":0.013081395068451962,"c":1,"x":0.82375478888393128},{"w":0.034482758839925132,"t":"Q21","y":0.69622092998996943,"h":0.011627907397322002,"x":0.82375478906662736,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395068451962,"c":1,"t":"Q22","x":0.82375478888393128,"w":0.036398468017578067,"y":0.79215116289241561},{"w":0.036398468017578067,"y":0.95058139509133421,"h":0.014534883945238386,"c":1,"t":"115","x":0.86973180060806921}],"w":2400,"h":3164}